# XERJ reference coding

Before writing non-trivial Gitronimo code (especially GPUI layout, Git UX, staging/history/diff, command palette, sidebars), search how closest open-source peers already solved it — then adapt or re-implement.

## Local node

- Binary: `~/.local/bin/xerj` (`xerj v1.0.0-rc.14+`)
- ES-compat API: `http://127.0.0.1:9200` (quote globs in zsh: `'gitronimo-*/_search'`)
- Indices for this setup use prefix `gitronimo-` (main corpus: `gitronimo-docs`)
- Helper: `.xerj/search.sh "your mechanism question"`
- Do not commit `.xerj/` (gitignored). Ignore helpers: `.xerjignore`, `docs/.xerjignore`

